> Original abacaba radii and byte positions

Retain s=abacaba, n=7, transform length17 and original radius
array[0,0,1,0,3,0,1,0,7,0,1,0,3,0,1,0,0]. The actual maximum center is8 with
radius7 and original start floor((8−7)/2)=0. With this transform every
nonsentinel radius equals the length in original bytes of the palindrome at that
center. Scanning centers in increasing order and accepting only strictly larger
radii preserves the leftmost longest occurrence; babad therefore chooses bab
rather than aba.

The report obtains the actual integer transform from the producer instead of
rebuilding a ^/#/$ string for display. Original bytes have values0..255,
separator256, left guard257 and right guard258. Native labels make every role
explicit without confusing an original punctuation byte with a control. The
original ASCII fixture needs no external dataset.

```{cpp, results="markdown", file="figures/manacher_original.svg", flags="-std=c++23 -O2 $(pkg-config --cflags --libs datamunge) -Wl,-rpath,$(pkg-config --variable=libdir datamunge)"}
#include <dm/dm.hpp>
#include <datamunge/algorithms/manacher.hpp>
#include <datamunge/plot/plot.hpp>
#include <filesystem>
#include <print>
int main() {
    std::filesystem::create_directories("build");
    auto t = dm::algorithms::manacher_trace("abacaba");
    auto &a = t.analysis;
    std::print("Actual original bytes {}; transform symbols {}; actual maximum center {}; selected start " "{}; length {}; returned run {}.\n\n| actual transformed index | actual tagged symbol | " "native role label | actual radius |\n| ---: | ---: | --- | ---: |\n",
               t.input.size(), t.symbols.size(), a.best_center, a.longest.start,
               a.longest.length,
               t.input.substr(a.longest.start, a.longest.length));
    std::vector<double> x, y;
    for (std::size_t i = 0; i < t.symbols.size(); ++i) {
        std::print("| {} | {} | {} | {} |\n", i, t.symbols[i],
                   dm::algorithms::manacher_symbol_label(t.symbols[i]),
                   a.radii[i]);
        x.push_back(i);
        y.push_back(a.radii[i]);
    }
    auto p = dm::graphics::RPlot::create();
    p.bars(x, y, "actual radii", {37, 99, 235}, .7).y_limits(0, 10).title(
        "Original abacaba: actual tagged-transform radii").x_label(
        "actual transformed symbol index").y_label("actual radius = original palindrome byte length").save_svg("build/manacher_original.svg");
}
